{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>SpaceX成功回收星艦S42後，馬斯克發帖：「我擁抱了42號飛船的回歸」。在團隊的陪伴下，馬斯克登上發射/捕獲塔頂，近距離檢視飛回家的S42「小」寶貝。星艦攝影賬號IGW遠距離拍到了他在塔上的照片。從獨特的走姿可以判斷出，塔頂左一為馬斯克。注意，老馬身高1.88米，S42身高約52米。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1115/af5c0e1b52d72aa.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1115/7acfd8ed3c553ee.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>Avid Space捕捉到了老馬在捕捉臂下抬頭查看S42的鏡頭。（左一）</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1115/fe5acaa26ac5528.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>馬斯克也興奮地分享了自己用手機在不同角度拍攝的S42視頻。</p>\n<p>可以看到，和老馬一起登頂的有十幾個人：</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1115/6e7e55a87b692c1.gif\">\n</p>\n<p>此外，多個星艦攝影賬號分享了大量美圖，這裏揀選分享一些。</p>\n<p>「射向羣星」——星城SpaceX團隊正在狂歡慶祝15飛的成功</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1115/3d586044f6f5230.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>「S42回家」——John Kraus製作的多幀合成圖</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1115/706e571752f4a2c.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>「下一站月球」——圖：NSF</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1115/0a530b8e765021f.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>宇宙的答案是42，「正如偉大的先知Douglas Adams所預言的那樣」——埃隆·馬斯克。攝影：John Kraus</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1115/2e29f2b618ae568.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>「Home, sweet home」——圖：Fabian Ramirez</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1115/61ab6ebb7e04f5f.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>「不要驚慌」——圖：LaunchHeavenX</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1115/7379ef621e89698.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>「等待」——圖：NSF</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1115/4e5522521e3e9d3.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>「剎車」——圖：John Kraus</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1115/e2a33d3510cb428.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>「煙火」——圖：John Kraus</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1115/c972e0c37abc22f.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>「文明和進步」——法國人在星城自費建造的普羅米修斯雕像</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1115/b99c332ae296a8f.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>「上升」——圖：John Kraus</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1115/bedc14acca993a6.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>「地球人類製造」——埃隆·馬斯克</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1115/12ce366a30f35b2.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>「遠望」及大量發射前的作品——圖：John Kraus</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2026_47/5D7534BCB75F733673F2B796D1E54202696EFECC_size39_w1080_h360.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2026_47/811738865B8F12EB7218416AFFE703A550B0AC6E_size126_w833_h1250.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2026_47/3079450FEFDC0953547F4F6FE2EE4875FD158A2A_size137_w833_h1250.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://x0.ifengimg.com/ucms/2026_47/DFD2F09D28A877BDAD917EFAACE4AE5C091BA253_size73_w625_h1250.jpg\">\n</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T07:57:30.066536+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":597,"images":20,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T07:32:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T00:43:22.638743+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T07:51:16.469975+00:00","content_hash":"4a7cb9800f2925bd893be7be82df4899629644c1a8b4465b7a55540a5af6ee7d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}